{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "06b42b83-1126-88ce-a402-132cd6e67308",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T11:44:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Paulo Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. My name is Paulo Amaral. I'm calling about the trash and recycling pickup. I need the new schedule after the holiday week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Paulo. Let me pull that up. So you're asking about the holiday shift, like everything got pushed back a day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Before, my pickup was Thursday. After the holidays they came Friday. Now I don't know if it is back to Thursday or if it stays Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me check. I'm looking at the schedule notes here. The holiday delay usually runs just for that week, and then everybody goes back to the regular day the week after. So it should be back to Thursday by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Back to Thursday. And the recycling, same day? Or is it every other week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling is the same day as your trash, but it alternates. So trash every week, recycling every other week. Do you remember which week they took the blue bin last?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think they took it the Friday after New Year. The first Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so that was the first week of January. Then two weeks later, that would be around the middle of the month, then two more, then two more. So counting forward, recycling lands this Thursday, tomorrow actually. Writing that down, recycling Thursday the fifth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday the fifth. Okay. Wait, today is Wednesday, so tomorrow is Thursday. Yes. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, tomorrow. Put the bin out the night before or early, by about seven in the morning to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven. Okay. My truck, you know, sometimes it is the problem, because my old truck takes a while to start most mornings. I am moving it so they can get the street. So maybe I put the bins out the night before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, night before works fine. Just set them at the curb, not in the road, lids closed. Easygoing on that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry, one second. Mano, un momentu, N sta na telefone. [pause] Okay, sorry. My cousin is asking something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:42:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:42:08-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I am back. So there is another thing. Last two times, they missed my recycling. The bin was out, and it is still full the next day. I want a supervisor to call me back about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:42:28-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Missed recycling, bin was out on time, still full. I can put in a request for a supervisor to call you. Let me grab a few things. Can I get a good callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:42:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-four. Got it. And is there a best time to reach you? Mornings, afternoons?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon is better. After one o'clock. In the morning I am working and also dealing with the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:43:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After one, got it. Writing that down. Callback after one p.m., missed recycling pickup two times, supervisor to call. Anything else you want me to note for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that the bin was at the curb before seven both times. Not blocked by a car. I made sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:43:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bin at the curb before seven, not blocked. I'll add that. I can't say exactly when they'll call, but it goes to the supervisor today, so likely today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today or tomorrow. Okay. If I miss the call, they leave a message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They should leave a message with a name, yeah. And you can always call back here and ask for the supervisor's line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:44:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. So, to repeat, trash Thursday, recycling Thursday tomorrow, and the supervisor calls after one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. That's exactly right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:44:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:44:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Paulo. Have a good rest of your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:44:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
